{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_shwaz_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_shwaz_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"普通的一天","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_shwaz_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"40811ab87bfa9111f519bfdefb550693c43fcac18f2ab5c107b64e8543defff9","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"錫蘭生日當天，黑和往常一樣，打算把手上的事情一一解決之後，為小姐慶祝生日。然而，這天上午，卻出了一點小意外——","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請用茶，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，過了明天，又要有一段時間喝不到你泡的紅茶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我完成本年度的教官任務後，我會申請調職的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種時候，你就應該說“既然大小姐這麼希望的話，那我就不回去了”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，那我待會就遞交離職申請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那還是算了。你真的辭職的話，我可是要被本艦的人記恨死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我該去辦事處了。我記得你白天在治安局對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，查理最近因為一群流寇的事情忙得不可開交，託我幫他帶一帶新人，我等一下就過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就晚上見吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上六點，“純白火山”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"黑，你現在有空嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查理找我，不過還有點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"錫蘭的事情，我想問問你的意見，我在“純白火山”等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間過得真快啊，黑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很久以前，我和芭芭拉也常來這樣的餐吧消磨時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您從沒說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多事情在心裡藏久了，就沒了說出來的慾望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我居然讓我的女兒從其他人那裡聽說她母親的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想和小姐聊聊夫人的事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生日派對是個不錯的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只怕，我願意說，她不願意聽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐會聽的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您只需要做好心理準備，同時承受她的怨氣就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈，說得也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我該多做一些準備，多告訴她一些她母親的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了。大概是66年的時候，那年，維多利亞把議會裡的所有人都弄得焦頭爛額。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芭芭拉那時候就在火山上做研究了，那裡沒有訊號，無法隨時保持聯絡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結婚紀念日那天，我們約好，我去火山腳下接她，然後我們一起去餐廳吃飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果，那天我臨時有一個脫不開身的政府會議要參加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼的聲音","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我趕到火山腳下的時候，天已經暗下來了，預訂好的餐廳用餐時間也錯過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼的聲音","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時很沮喪，覺得一切都完了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）嘿，笨蛋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她沒有生氣，反而安慰我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我在夕陽下，看著她的側臉時，我忽然像是得到了上天的指引一樣——在路邊摘了幾朵花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，不是火山預警花，就是那種，在火山腳下隨處可見的花朵。"},{"type":"narration","text":"赫爾曼說著，拿起餐桌上插在水杯中的裝飾花，像是身臨其境一般，遞向身邊的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把花朵插在她的髮梢，然後向她遞出了求婚戒指。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得這段往事怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，市長先生，謝謝您的花……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？黑呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"不太清楚，我也是聽到動靜才從廚房出來看一看的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放開我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你的錢包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼——？！這個可惡的小鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"跟我過來，我要帶你去治安局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我不去，放開我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把他交給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她就是治安局的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你、您是赫爾曼市長？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，交給這位小姐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"市長先生都這麼說了，我當然相信您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以走了，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"……你不打算抓我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想被我抓去治安局嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"不想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次再被我抓到，我會帶你去比治安局更可怕的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"……哼，別以為我會被你嚇唬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼放過他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的腳上有些礦灰，他的衣服也不像是他自己的衣服……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我剛才抓住他的時候，在他的身上看到了一些源石結晶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是，他可能和私挖黑曜石的工人有關？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，那不是更該交給治安局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查理知道怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他未必知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回來之後，我去過一趟治安局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得查理做得不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我走之前對他的交代他都完成得還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但有些事情，當時的我也沒想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在還來得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐和我提過一位佩利佩先生的事情，我想見他一面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"私挖黑曜石的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你找錯人了，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火山都噴發了，現在還有誰會反對市長當時的決策？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都接受啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火山剛剛噴發完，對某些人來說，這是最好的發財機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你懷疑他們買通了一些私挖黑曜石的工人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我不告訴你，是不是就輪到我大禍臨頭了，前治安局局長，黑女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我會自己找。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，按照你的要求，我讓新人們換上了礦工的裝備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在開始，忘了你們是治安局的人，你們只是一群打算去火山上冒險的礦工。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工們？","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，你打算讓他們裝成礦工引出那群流寇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我打算讓他們真的去學習礦工們是怎麼生活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能引出那群流寇最好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我能問問為什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有讓他們理解私挖黑曜石的人都在做什麼，他們才能在未來真正地解決這個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……錫蘭大小姐的意思嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這確實像是小姐會說的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這是我的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查理","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"……我知道了，我也去換一套衣服吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，路上再換。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答應過那位錫蘭小姐，在她想做事的時候，會幫她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在看來，幫你也是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩利佩","speakerId":"avg_npc_995_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交給我吧，我來幫你們牽線。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你們就是新來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"小孩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"對我尊重一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"沒我帶路，你們別想找到黑曜石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你們又是為什麼冒著這麼大的風險來挖礦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"佩利佩那個老頭給我們找的工作實在賺不了多少錢，我們是真的缺錢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，赫爾曼那個老頭子也真是糊塗，放著這麼一座金山不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"都知道規矩吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，絕對不洩密，絕對不怕死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，我們可不像佩利佩那麼假惺惺，只要你有礦，我們就給你錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來吧，下面還有許多你們的同伴呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你們就在這裡好好工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男孩消失在山洞的深處，渾然不知，在他的身後，有一雙眼睛在盯著他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看門的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"新來的這批看起來都蠻強壯的，應該能挖不少黑曜石出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看門的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯，進去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看門的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看門的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼感覺有什麼東西過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看門的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，這種地方怎麼可能有其他人來，多半是錯覺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）和預想的差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）營地顯然是火山爆發後建成的，能在短時間內找到這麼深的地方，對方恐怕早就滲透進礦工之中了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）人數在二十個左右。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）那個孩子……應該就在前面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說你今天去了城裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怎麼知道的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該告訴過你，不要隨便進城，也不要引人注目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你們又不給我錢，又不讓我出去透透氣，我快要悶死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道你差點被這座城市最危險的傢伙抓到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道她發什麼瘋，居然把你放了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"那個女人很危險嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你以為我們為什麼躲在這種地方，就是怕觸了那尊瘟神的楣頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"還有羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好該賺的也賺得差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"傳下去，讓兄弟們準備卸貨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！終於要走了，我都要被這鬼地方熱死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"卸貨……是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你要成為我們的一員，確實也該告訴你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"卸貨的意思，就是殺了下面那群礦工，然後帶著黑曜石和錢走人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要殺了他們？下面還有一批新人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"那就算他們倒楣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的想幹這一行，這就是你必須要上的一課——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"永遠不要留下後患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"他們見過你，你見過我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，如果你不想被我們殺死，你想成為我們的一員——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"那他們就得死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了是誰在你父母死後把你從礦洞裡拉出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，但是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己說過的，你不想像你父母那樣賺一輩子辛苦錢，你想賺大錢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了嗎？明白了的話，就給我一個明確的答覆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是之前的那個——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過，再次見面時，我會帶你去比治安局更恐怖的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不想殺那些礦工！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都和我爸媽一樣！我、我嚇他們只是好玩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的時間……是下午三點二十。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果把握時間的話，說不定還有機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你的眼睛閉上，小鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡猾的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來會發生的事情，對你來說不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……算了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒等男孩反應過來，黑已經來到他的身邊，將他擊暈，然後扛在肩膀上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是這樣更快一點。"},{"type":"narration","text":"遠處接連響起一些慘叫，那是她事先設好的陷阱。但更多的，是逐漸逼近的腳步聲。\n這讓她想起了獨自一人殲滅仇家的那一夜。\n那時候，她也是孤身一人，面對著數十倍的敵人。\n她想，如果是那時的自己，身邊有這樣一個孩子，她大概是不會做那樣的事的。\n但現在，她覺得這樣是理所當然的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您居然真的一個人就解決了這群流寇？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經和查理說過了，你們分兩隊：一隊清理流寇的據點，一隊安撫受驚的其他礦工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"是！我們馬上就行動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"還有什麼命令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把這個孩子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個孩子得了礦石病吧，先讓我檢查一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡比較平坦，把他平放在這裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你怎麼來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是佩利佩先生不放心，打了個電話給我，我恐怕還要被蒙在鼓裡呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我一個人能解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"病情蔓延得還不算快，應該是最近才感染的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能把這孩子送去羅德島的辦事處嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個孩子是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是某對私挖黑曜石的礦工夫妻的孩子，他的父母因為礦難去世了，他無依無靠的，就被那些流寇盯上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"流寇們最喜歡吸收這種孩子成為他們的一員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我在羅德島上也聽過不少這樣的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的性格很頑劣，恐怕短時間內是無法改變的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你打算怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想把他託付給羅德島在汐斯塔的辦事處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救治礦石病人本來就是我們的責任，更何況他還失去了父母。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，這件事就交給羅德島辦事處這邊安排吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，現在公事算是解決了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"錫蘭說著，拍了一下手掌，臉上露出笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒受傷吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，一群流寇而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那個孩子，我發現他沒有受傷，是你救下來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是因為顧慮到這個孩子，你應該能用更少的時間解決裡面的流寇吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概……能節省至少十分鐘吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話，或許趕得上你的生日派對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我又不會真的因為這種事責怪你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，其實我很高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道以前的你是什麼樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我花了很長時間適應你的那一面，就像你其實也花了許多時間適應和我一起生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們為對方改變了一些，但也遷就了一些對方固執的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如我對礦石病的執著，比如你做事的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你能回新汐斯塔，但我心裡其實又有些害怕。我怕等我們真的一起工作時，反而會有衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，現在確實不會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會等你回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是五點半，從這裡到“純白火山”的車程，至少也要一個小時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的生日派對算是泡湯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……老爺現在應該正在“純白火山”等著給你一個驚喜，現在過去還來得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他讓我等了這麼久，現在等我一下也沒什麼關係吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的禮物呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不允許你用什麼來不及去取之類的藉口蒙混過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她看著自家大小姐的目光，難得有些窘迫。\n這就是錫蘭的性格，想要什麼，就會去爭取。\n她當然準備了禮物，現在它大概還躺在商業街的那家首飾店裡。\n現在開車過去拿，然後再去“純白火山”，應該還來得及。\n她正想這麼說，但這時，她看到落日的餘暉灑在了錫蘭的側臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，黑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來幫你戴上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你準備的生日禮物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火山腳下的野花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然沒有火山預警花那樣的意義，但是，能夠在火山腳下盛開，本來就代表著堅韌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而火山是汐斯塔的代表，站在這裡，能夠把新舊汐斯塔的風景都盡收眼底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並且，普通的野花，還可以有一層含義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都是生活在火山腳下的普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是——這些花還蠻漂亮的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，這次就這麼放過你好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"據說，老爺就是這樣挽回了一次和夫人的婚姻危機的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的假的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽那時候，一定和我想到了一樣的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以去向老爺求證一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑，你最近很幫他說話嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺也等了一段時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道啦，我會和他聊一聊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我還沒吃飯呢，餓死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天你沒什麼事情吧？我來幫你收拾行李，順便幫我帶點禮物給本艦的一些朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說起來，你挑的蛋糕是什麼口味？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巧克力榛子，你上週說想吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_348_ceylon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是黑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈——哈啾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，市長先生，怎麼只有您一個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"今天不是錫蘭小姐的生日派對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑那邊出了點狀況，我女兒先去了她那邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"噢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"您不過去沒關係嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我知道的時候，黑已經把事情解決了，錫蘭人也在那邊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只能在這裡等她們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位小姐沒事就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，您手裡的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我今天特意去火山腳下採的一束野花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，難怪我覺得那麼眼熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經，我就是用這些花化解了我的婚姻危機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，希望它們也能化解一些我和女兒之間的隔閡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"您準備得這麼充分，為什麼我覺得您還是有點愁眉苦臉的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在剛才忽然有一種感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺我準備的這招……不管用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……為什麼呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
